        "subs": [
          "To change the enchantment on the gauntlets, use the right-click <i>switch</i> option for 25,000 coins each time. To own all three versions simultaneously, first speak with Dimintheis about buying new steel gauntlets, then visit the other two respective brothers and pay them 1,000,000 coins each.",
